                     ; 2da29623-f756-496d-81b6-4790f8e26e49 ; Arrows In Your Quiver Webinar Series: Supercharge Your Exercise                                                                                                                         ; Regular exercise is integral to living a healthful life. In Part 9 of this 12-part series, Dr. Burdette will highlight how to maximize exercise programs and make the most of the recommended 150 minutes per week.                     ; <p>Join naturopathic physician and the education director for XYMOGEN, Dr. Cheryl Burdette, for an informative 12-part series highlighting XYMOGEN’s professional formulas. Dr. Burdette will review clinical applications for each specialty category and inform attendees how to utilize individual products in their practice to achieve optimal patient results.</p><br> <p>As part of a healthy lifestyle, exercise is crucial to maintaining overall wellness and reducing the risk of chronic health conditions. The standard exercise recommendation is 150 minutes per week, which may sound like a lot but breaks down to just over 20 minutes per day. Join Dr. Burdette for Part 9 of this 12-part series, where she will discuss how to supercharge any exercise program to maximize the benefits, improving outcomes and overall health.</p> ; OVER_1_HOUR ; false ; supercharge-your-exercise ; supercharge-your-exercise ; PUBLISHED ; https://media.umbraco.io/webs-courteous-wombat/awzkhjx0/xymogen-logo-webinar-sponsor.png ; xymogen-logo-webinar-sponsor ; Sponsor logo image for XYMOGEN ; Xymogen ; 23017e30-7dba-4209-9808-ab0533ddc0b3 ; 111,105,103 ; "https://webwholescriptstorage.blob.core.windows.net/wholescriptvideos/Webinars/Arrows in Your Quiver 12-Part Series - Amplify Your Exercise (XYMOGEN) 03232023_1.mp4" ; "https://webwholescriptstorage.blob.core.windows.net/wholescriptvideos/Webinar Captions/Arrows_in_Your_Quiver_12-Part_Series_-_Pain_Management__(XYMOGEN)_02232023_1.vtt" ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_02,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_03,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_04,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_06,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_12,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_13,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_14,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_15,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_16,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_18,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_24,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_19,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_21
                     ; b131ef67-48f7-4105-bef9-a3541a97c9b1 ; Arrows In Your Quiver Webinar Series: Gut Health: How to Break the Bellyache                                                                                                            ; Pain and dysfunction in the GI tract can occur even when eating a balanced diet. Tune into Part 8 to learn how to identify the causes behind gut issues and the clinical solutions for solving the mysteries of gut health.             ; <p>Join naturopathic physician and the education director for XYMOGEN, Dr. Cheryl Burdette, for an informative 12-part series highlighting XYMOGEN’s professional formulas. Dr. Burdette will review clinical applications for each specialty category and inform attendees how to utilize individual products in their practice to achieve optimal patient results.</p><br> <p>The health of the gastrointestinal (GI) tract is pivotal for overall wellness and closely tied to food intake. Yet some individuals find themselves with constant GI distress regardless of recommended dietary accommodations. In Part 8 of this 12-part series, Dr. Burdette will share her in-depth knowledge in identifying potential culprits that contribute to gut issues and suggest clinical solutions for optimizing gut health to ease common discomforts.</p> ; OVER_1_HOUR ; false ; gut-health-how-to-break-the-bellyache ; gut-health-how-to-break-the-bellyache ; PUBLISHED ; https://media.umbraco.io/webs-courteous-wombat/awzkhjx0/xymogen-logo-webinar-sponsor.png ; xymogen-logo-webinar-sponsor ; Sponsor logo image for XYMOGEN ; Xymogen ; 23017e30-7dba-4209-9808-ab0533ddc0b3 ; 115,100,109 ; "https://webwholescriptstorage.blob.core.windows.net/wholescriptvideos/Webinars/Arrows in Your Quiver 12-Part Series - How to Beat the Bellyache  (XYMOGEN) 03162023_1.mp4" ; "https://webwholescriptstorage.blob.core.windows.net/wholescriptvideos/Webinar Captions/Arrows_in_Your_Quiver_12-Part_Series_-_Evidence-Based_Weight_Management_(XYMOGEN.vtt" ; Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_02,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_06,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_09,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_12,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_13,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_19,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_25,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_21,Z_PRODUCT_CATEGORIES_26
                     ; 99123826-45e0-4618-8419-b55e9490a197 ; Arrows In Your Quiver Webinar Series: Evidence-Based Weight Management                                                                                                                  ; Maintaining a healthy weight significantly impacts overall health and well-being, but what strategies best support weight management? In Part 7, evidence-based approaches to long-term weight management are discussed.                ; <p>Join naturopathic physician and the education director for XYMOGEN, Dr. Cheryl Burdette, for an informative 12-part series highlighting XYMOGEN’s professional formulas. Dr. Burdette will review clinical applications for each specialty category and inform attendees how to utilize individual products in their practice to achieve optimal patient results.</p><br> <p>Determination of what constitutes a healthy weight and how to best support long-term weight management is specific to each individual. With so much variation in the information available at our fingertips, it’s no wonder both consumers and practitioners are confused about claims for products that support a healthy weight. So how does one sift through the hype and select products or strategies to initiate a healthy weight management journey? Join Dr. Burdette for Part 7 of this 12-part series as she reviews an evidence-based approach to long-term weight maintenance.</p> ; OVER_1_HOUR ; false ; semalglutide-adjuncts-and-natural-glp-1-management ; semalglutide-adjuncts-and-natural-glp-1-management ; PUBLISHED ; https://media.umbraco.io/webs-courteous-wombat/awzkhjx0/xymogen-logo-webinar-sponsor.png ; xymogen-logo-webinar-sponsor ; Sponsor logo image for XYMOGEN ; Xymogen ; 23017e30-7dba-4209-9808-ab0533ddc0b3 ; 103,115,119 ; "https://webwholescriptstorage.blob.core.windows.net/wholescriptvideos/Webinars/Arrows in Your Quiver 12-Part Series - Evidence-Based Weight Management (XYMOGEN) 03092023_1.mp4" ; "https://webwholescriptstorage.blo